From d398b42314dd0beb5acbc6c3ce670ae05d6187df Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vraxa <200693817+vraxa@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 22:44:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Replay Shake: a camera shake for the replay editor, set per
 keyframe

Shakes the view the replay editor renders from, like a handheld camera:
handheld, walking, running, vehicle, earthquake, drift or custom, per
keyframe, blending from one keyframe to the next. Exports match the
editor. A REPLAY SHAKE tab in SETTINGS and replayshake console commands.
The replay editor's camera is known for skate. build 25414733.

On Animator Studio 2.1.5 (ReSkate 20261116).
